Z||000024||Ken Wittlief||09-15-2001||02:07 PM||||some of the photos show people falling from the building - one mans shirt appears to be missing as he falls<P> but I didnt see anything that would be considered graphic<P> my son was at high school when the first tower was hit - and they put the news on in almost every class room in the school.<P> during the live coverage he said they showed people jumping and hitting the ground, and they saw the second plane hit as it happened live.<P>  From my frame of reference 'graphic' would be photos of mangled dead bodies.<P>  on TV today they showed a photo of fireman carrying the body of father Micheal away as the building collasped behind them - he was hit and killed while administering last rites to victims at the site - it will be in peoples magazine - I think it will be one of the images of the century - the firemen carrying the body of their fallen Chaplan.<p>[This message has been edited by Ken Wittlief (edited 09-15-2001).]||||reg||1
